---
layout: base
title: Actualités
description: "Les actualités et événements de CAP'AVENIR78 — aide aux devoirs, stages de vacances, et soutien scolaire dans les Yvelines (78)."
permalink: /actualites/index.html
---

<!-- ═══ ACTUALITÉS HERO ═══════════════════════════════════════ -->
<section class="relative bg-gradient-to-br from-[#1a3a6b] to-[#0d2550] py-12 sm:py-16 lg:py-20 overflow-hidden">
  <div class="absolute top-0 right-0 w-64 h-64 bg-[#2a9d8f]/10 rounded-full -translate-y-1/2 translate-x-1/2" aria-hidden="true"></div>
  <div class="absolute bottom-0 left-0 w-48 h-48 bg-[#f4a020]/10 rounded-full translate-y-1/2 -translate-x-1/2" aria-hidden="true"></div>
  <div class="w-full lg:w-1/2 xl:w-2/5 mx-auto px-4 sm:px-6 lg:px-8 relative z-10 text-center">
    <div class="inline-flex items-center gap-2 text-[#f4a020] font-bold text-sm uppercase tracking-widest mb-4">
      <span class="w-8 h-0.5 bg-[#f4a020]"></span>Restez informés<span class="w-8 h-0.5 bg-[#f4a020]"></span>
    </div>
    <h1 class="text-2xl sm:text-3xl lg:text-5xl font-black text-white mb-4" style="font-family:Montserrat,sans-serif">Actualités</h1>
    <div class="w-16 h-1 bg-[#f4a020] rounded-full mx-auto mb-6"></div>
    <p class="text-blue-200 max-w-2xl mx-auto text-base leading-relaxed">
      Retrouvez toutes les actualités, événements et informations de {{ site.name }}.
    </p>
  </div>
</section>

<!-- ═══ ARTICLES LIST ═════════════════════════════════════════ -->
<section class="py-12 sm:py-16 lg:py-20 bg-[#f8faff]">
  <div class="w-full lg:w-4/5 xl:w-3/5 mx-auto px-4 sm:px-6 lg:px-8">

  {% if collections.actus.length > 0 %}
    <div class="grid gap-6">
      {% for article in collections.actus %}
      {% set thumb = article.templateContent | firstImage %}
      <article class="bg-white rounded-3xl overflow-hidden shadow-sm border border-gray-100 hover:shadow-xl transition-all duration-300 hover:-translate-y-1 flex flex-col sm:flex-row" data-animate>
        <div class="sm:w-48 md:w-56 sm:flex-shrink-0 bg-[#1a3a6b]/5 flex items-center justify-center h-40 sm:h-auto overflow-hidden">
          {% if thumb %}
            <img src="{{ thumb }}" alt="" class="w-full h-full object-cover" loading="lazy" />
          {% else %}
            <div class="w-16 h-16 rounded-2xl flex items-center justify-center" style="background-color:#1a3a6b15">
              <svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="32" height="32" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="#1a3a6b" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"><path d="M14 22v-4a2 2 0 1 0-4 0v4"/><path d="m18 10 3.447 1.724a1 1 0 0 1 .553.894V20a2 2 0 0 1-2 2H4a2 2 0 0 1-2-2v-7.382a1 1 0 0 1 .553-.894L6 10"/><path d="M18 5v17"/><path d="m4 6 8-4 8 4"/><path d="M6 5v17"/><circle cx="12" cy="9" r="2"/></svg>
            </div>
          {% endif %}
        </div>
        <div class="p-6 sm:p-8 flex-1">
          <div class="mb-2">
            <h2 class="text-lg font-black text-[#1a3a6b] leading-snug" style="font-family:Montserrat,sans-serif">
              <a href="{{ article.url }}" class="hover:text-[#2a9d8f] transition-colors">{{ article.data.title or article.fileSlug }}</a>
            </h2>
            {% if article.date %}
            <time class="text-xs text-gray-400 font-semibold mt-1 inline-block">
              {{ article.date | readableDate }}
            </time>
            {% endif %}
          </div>
          {% set excerpt = article.templateContent | stripMarkdownImages | striptags | safe %}
          <p class="text-gray-500 text-sm leading-relaxed mb-4 line-clamp-2">{{ excerpt }}</p>
          <a href="{{ article.url }}" class="inline-flex items-center gap-1.5 text-[#2a9d8f] font-bold text-sm hover:text-[#1a3a6b] transition-colors group">
            Lire la suite
            <svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="14" height="14" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" class="group-hover:translate-x-1 transition-transform"><path d="M5 12h14"/><path d="m12 5 7 7-7 7"/></svg>
          </a>
        </div>
      </article>
      {% endfor %}
    </div>
  {% else %}
    <div class="text-center py-16" data-animate>
      <div class="w-20 h-20 bg-[#f4a020]/10 rounded-full flex items-center justify-center mx-auto mb-6">
        <svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="32" height="32" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="#f4a020" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"><rect width="18" height="18" x="3" y="3" rx="2" ry="2"/><line x1="12" x2="12" y1="8" y2="16"/><line x1="8" x2="16" y1="12" y2="12"/></svg>
      </div>
      <h2 class="text-2xl font-black text-[#1a3a6b] mb-3" style="font-family:Montserrat,sans-serif">Bientôt des actualités</h2>
      <p class="text-gray-600">Revenez prochainement pour découvrir nos actualités et événements.</p>
    </div>
  {% endif %}

  </div>
</section>
